<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Oh, that fine linen garment</l><l>Which on that day we’ll wear</l><l>E’en now, Lord, work within us</l><l>And stitch by stitch prepare.</l><l>For this we would redeem</l><l>Every moment opportune</l><l>For the wedding day that’s coming</l><l>Very soon.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, may Your portion in us</l><l>Continually increase</l><l>That we may be invited</l><l>Unto that wedding feast.</l><l>And keep us always watching—</l><l>At morning, night, or noon—</l><l>For the wedding day that’s coming</l><l>Very soon.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
